	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0101_adultw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あら？　もしかして
ジムリーダーを　さがしに　きたの▼
ざんねんね……　ちょうど　いれかわりで
ジムに　むかっていったわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:07:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:06:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら？　もしかして
ジムリーダーを　探しに　来たの▼
残念ね……　ちょうど　いれかわりで
ジムに　向かっていったわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:01:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:12:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・c04ジムバッジ取得で削除
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:08:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ADULTW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:06:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0101_adultw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジムリーダーね
