			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:08:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジムリーダーね
ジェットコースターの　スリルで▽
無心に　なるのが　好きだって</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T07:01:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T08:12:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・adultw_01表示後に会話
・c04ジムバッジ取得まで繰り返し
